{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_08BF20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“贤者们”……那是20世纪初美国、中国、俄国缔结的秘密协定，以及支撑它的那些权势人物……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":131,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当然，到那时美苏两国的“贤者”早已分道扬镳。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，留在苏联一方的“贤者”中，也有势力对共产党的一党独裁心怀不满。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"The Boss与他们取得了联系。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"她在柏林秘密接触这些人，寻找通往<R=苏联第一设计局,OKB-1>的门路。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=苏联第一设计局,OKB-1>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"她有时塞给对方大笔金钱，有时协助他们叛逃，以此拉拢亲美者。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对她来说，这伴随着巨大的风险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"“贤者们”掌握着The Boss的一切情报。不，还不只是情报。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"她在战场上生下的孩子，也在出生后立刻被“贤者们”夺走。这件事你应该也听说过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"如果那个孩子落在苏联一方“贤者”的手中……遭遇危险的也许就不只是她一个人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"即便如此，她也别无选择。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"当时，人们认为苏联部署的导弹数量远远超过美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"如果这是真的，就意味着苏联已经摆脱了核威慑的枷锁。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"一旦发生什么，苏联甚至可能真的发射核武器……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"但你也知道，所谓“导弹差距”其实只是苏联的虚张声势。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"苏联倾尽全力让外界相信这个假象，甚至可以说，他们的太空开发本身也是这场骗局的一部分。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"可在当时，谁也不知道这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"她曾带着自嘲说：“我也是被‘导弹差距’这条情报耍得团团转的人之一。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"为了<R=祖国,AMERICA>，也为了避免核战争，她主动踏进了险境。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=祖国,AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"在她不惜性命的努力下，总算在<R=设计局,OKB-1>内部安插了一名潜伏特工。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=设计局,OKB-1>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>也因此开始获得东方阵营的大量技术情报。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"到1959年底，搭载黑猩猩“Sam”的火箭成功完成了弹道飞行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"虽然只是大气层内的弹道飞行，但这次成功让NASA对自己的技术充满信心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"就在行动逐渐步入正轨时，CIA找上了门。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"他们说：“你是大战英雄，没必要一直做这种<R=脏活,BLACK OPS>。剩下的就交给我们吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=脏活,BLACK OPS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"说穿了，他们只是想把成果据为己有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"但The Boss干脆地让了出去。她说：“需要我的<R=阶段,PHASE>已经结束了。之后别人怎么评价，我不感兴趣。”","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=阶段,PHASE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"NASA不断取得成果，而苏联的载人航天计划看起来却没有进展。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"“东方的技术人员正因为Sam平安归来而慌了手脚。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"潜伏其中的特工如此报告。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"苏联早就用斯普特尼克2号把生物送上了太空。“Kudryavka”……没错，就是那只莱卡犬。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"可是，<R=她,KUDRYAVKA>没能回到地球。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=她,KUDRYAVKA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"美国可以让返回的航天器落入海中，再进行回收。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"可苏联面向的是冰封的北冰洋。他们只能让航天器在陆地上着陆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"那么，他们要怎样缓解着陆时的冲击？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"潜伏特工报告说：“苏联还没有找到解决这个问题的方法。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"对苏联太空计划的妨碍看起来也进展顺利。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"斯普特尼克4号的重返大气层失败了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"两个月后的另一次发射中，火箭又在发射台上爆炸。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"斯普特尼克5号虽然把两只狗送入轨道并安全带回，但潜伏特工报告说，那只不过是偶然成功。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"狗也就罢了，苏联还没有让人类安全返回的技术……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"所有人都相信了这份情报，彻底放下了戒心。只有一个人例外——The Boss本人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"The Boss对送来的斯普特尼克5号结构图产生了疑问。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"那个太空舱上，装着一个不自然的弹射装置。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"她说：“按常理来说，根本不需要这种装置。它到底是要弹射什么……？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"NASA对她的疑问一笑置之。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"他们说：“大概是事故时用来弹射飞行记录仪的吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"The Boss坚持有必要调查，但CIA根本不理会。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"他们大概觉得，她只是想把成果重新抢回自己手里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"无法接受这一点的她独自前往苏联。据说CIA没有提供任何支援。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"就这样跨过新年，到1961年时，她终于亲自潜入了苏联的<R=第一设计局,OKB-1>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=第一设计局,OKB-1>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"在那里，她亲眼看到了真相。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""}]}